TI ipc trace logger
This tool prints to debug out.

Syntax:
ipc_trace_logger [Specific options]

[Specific options]:
    Specific options are separated by commas

tracebuffer_base=base        trace buffer base physical address
tracebuffer_size=size        (optional) trace buffer size  (default: 0x80000)
print_to_slog=<val>          (optional) Output to slog (val=1) or DebugOut (val=0) (default: 0)
wait_mode=<val>              (optional) wait mode, listen to new prints(val=1) or exit after done (val=0) (default: 0)



example:
    Run the logger to print to slog and wait mode
    ipc_trace_logger tracebuffer_base=0xa2b12400,tracebuffer_size=0x80000,print_to_slog=1,wait_mode=1
